Writing

Inside AxNotes:
## Writing
inside AxNotes

 -  Normal note
 - `[ ]` Open task
 - `[/]` In-progress task
 - `[x]` Completed task
 - `[>]` Migrated task
 - `[-]` Canceled task
 - `?`  Question
 - `!`  Important
 - `@`  Event
     › Supporting detail

- normal text creates a note
- `[` creates a task
- trailing `[x` or `[x]` marks a task complete
`[/`  creates an in-progress task
- trailing `[/ `[/]` marks a task in-progress 
`[>` creates a migrated task
- trailing `[> `[>]` marks a task migrated
`-]` or `[-] trailing marks a task as complete 


- `!` marks important
- `?` marks a question
- `>` creates a supporting detail
- `/` displays commands


## Commands

Everyday:

- `/today`
- `/week`
- `/search`
- `/help`
- `/quit`

Maintenance:

- `/reindex`
- `/sync`

Planned: `/lastweek` and `/month`. 
- `/markdown` or the alias `/md` opens the markdown file.
